{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/52cbdd6c84481f14e4d2badc8482e69b.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/52cbdd6c84481f14e4d2badc8482e69b.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Harvest Cafe gives players the opportunity to manage and farm their own farms. Players grow their farms by growing vegetables, fruits and other crops. They feed and care for animals to produce food such as milk, eggs and meat. They can also use the materials they gather from the environment to create new farmland and improve their farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/9cb09177997cd7951b3cebe03b0392fd.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/9cb09177997cd7951b3cebe03b0392fd.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Players sell the produce grown on their farms in their own restaurant in the village center. In the restaurant, players cook delicious food and serve it to customers. Players can diversify their menu by trying different recipes and prepare special dishes to increase customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.mp4?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game is set on a large island and offers players the opportunity to explore. Players explore and repair places such as abandoned harbors, buildings and shops. In this way, they revitalize the island and start attracting tourists. During exploration, players can find new seeds, animals and valuable materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/b164efb1c73252c260c998b8db8c58ab.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/b164efb1c73252c260c998b8db8c58ab.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Players use their business management skills to develop and grow their restaurant. In later levels, players can hire staff such as cooks and waiters to make their jobs easier and serve more customers. They can also use the money they earn to improve their restaurant and train their staff.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2762360?t=1772209682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/b8e6972c9e85cf103ea0d8ee0130ba40d6c9e0f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772209682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/399e7dfe9f3b289340ec07969ec44841b1e7fdbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772209682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/399e7dfe9f3b289340ec07969ec44841b1e7fdbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772209682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2910420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/w