 ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/7824f7284a4ba7a778c10dd00b3607ba.mp4?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game is set on a large island and offers players the opportunity to explore. Players explore and repair places such as abandoned harbors, buildings and shops. In this way, they revitalize the island and start attracting tourists. During exploration, players can find new seeds, animals and valuable materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/b164efb1c73252c260c998b8db8c58ab.poster.avif?t=1772209682\" width=1000 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762360/extras/b164efb1c73252c260c998b8db8c58ab.webm?t=1772209682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Players use their business management skills to develop and grow their restaurant. In later levels, players can hire staff such as cooks and waiters to make their jobs easier and serve more customers. They can also use the money they earn to improve their restaurant and train their staff.</p>","developers":["World of Poly"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic